== Trivia ==
* This item is a Rune counterpart to {{i|Blank Card}} and {{i|Placebo}}.
* This item's unlock method is likely a nod to its similar functionality to Blank Card but Clear Rune being unable to follow the same naming convention due to {{p|Blank Rune}} already existing.
* Despite being introduced in the ''Repentance'' DLC, Clear Rune's place in the Collection Menu is on Page 3, along with other ''Rebirth'' items. This is due to the item taking up a previously unused item id. This also means that this item needs to be unlocked and picked up in a normal run to get both {{a|!Platinum God!}} and {{a|The Real Platinum God}} achievements.

